1
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:14,410
Let's jump into the
Domain Name System.

2
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:18,360
The problem that we're
looking at here is

3
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:24,080
that the application layer
has its own addressing.

