9
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,940
whereas YouTube may
have servers in Denver,

10
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,640
New York, and many others.

11
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:58,100
With that, as we saw
with the link layer,

12
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:01,640
the network layer, we saw
