20
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:42,040
Now we went through
the differences that

21
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:45,750
Mac addresses are flat,
they're machine readable.

22
00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:49,060
IP addresses are hierarchical

23
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:52,155
to provide us this
