27
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:07,240
These are also now
variable length.

28
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:11,300
When we say hierarchical naming,

29
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:14,140
in this case with

30
00:02:14,140 --> 00:02:19,200
IP addresses to help us get
to particular destination.

31
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:26,000
Well, here they're organizing
