32
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,725
There's these top level domains,

33
00:02:28,725 --> 00:02:34,395
we see the edu.com.gov.

34
00:02:34,395 --> 00:02:37,960
mil.org and many others.

35
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:46,905
Within those, we then see
domains that precede that.

36
00:02:46,905 --> 00:02:50,400
We might have Princeton as part

37
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:54,060
