00:04:12,620 --> 00:04:18,600
a DNS message for our
query is effectively says,

60
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:21,720
where is YouTube.com and then

61
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:25,140
this distributed database
that's known as DNS,

