156
00:10:17,540 --> 00:10:22,245
Now we mentioned
these root servers,

157
00:10:22,245 --> 00:10:25,125
and these are pretty important.

158
00:10:25,125 --> 00:10:31,755
DNS is critical infrastructure
for the Internet and Web.

159
00:10:31,755 --> 00:10:36,195
The root servers are
critical within DNS.

160
00:10:36,195 --> 00:10:39,285
They're the ones that basically

161
00:10:39,285 --> 00:10:42,585
