these root servers.

168
00:11:05,325 --> 00:11:08,475
Their IP addresses are stable

169
00:11:08,475 --> 00:11:12,130
and they're configured
into the resolvers,

170
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:17,640
and then each root server is
