193
00:12:46,810 --> 00:12:50,670
and so forth, and then AS
3 will also advertise.

194
00:12:50,670 --> 00:12:54,045
Then wherever you
are in the Internet,

195
00:12:54,045 --> 00:12:55,920
so this router right

196
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:59,715
here would say I have
