211
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:59,175
2 might get redirected
to go to what's in AS 1.

212
00:13:59,175 --> 00:14:01,365
Just as AnyCast is

213
00:14:01,365 --> 00:14:03,990
the DNS root servers highly

214
00:14:03,990 --> 00:14:07,755
leverage that for
the redundancy.

215
00:14:07,755 --> 00:14:12,105
Now, getting back to DNS itself,

216
00:14:12,105 --> 00:14:17,265
the message format
